    "detailed_description": "The aftermath of a recently <i>abandoned space station</i>, once poised to propel humanity into a <u>new era</u>, a chilling tale of untapped potential unfurls. Its chambers, hold the enigma of a groundbreaking energy source that was meant to revolutionize our species.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2648550/extras/cce5949cc3a52b665048a5f6447075bf.poster.avif?t=1697741619\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2648550/extras/cce5949cc3a52b665048a5f6447075bf.webm?t=1697741619\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2648550/extras/cce5949cc3a52b665048a5f6447075bf.mp4?t=1697741619\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Chart your <strong>own</strong> course through the abandoned station, navigating your way to its core. Alternatively, venture off the beaten path and uncover the hidden mysteries the station conceals<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2648550/extras/77bc2fa149596791d5504ad40537a257.poster.avif?t=1697741619\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2648550/extras/77bc2fa149596791d5504ad40537a257.webm?t=1697741619\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2648550/extras/77bc2fa149596791d5504ad40537a257.mp4?t=1697741619\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Collect energy chits to <strong>upgrade</strong> your suit and switch on-the-fly to annihilate your enemies<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2648550/extras/0d39aee544b4f3d12120f3bdaef89ce8.poster.avif?t=1697741619\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2648550/extras/0d39aee544b4f3d12120f3bdaef89ce8.webm?t=1697741619\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2648550/extras/0d39aee544b4f3d12120f3bdaef89ce8.mp4?t=1697741619\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Leap, slide, or use your enemies as launchpads to reach new heights \u2013 <strong>fast-paced movement</strong> is your key to survival<br><br>Embark on an urgent mission to uncover the closely guarded secrets that led to its recent catastrophic downfall. Venture deep into the heart of the station, where you'll confront imminent challenges and unveil the hidden truths veiled in darkness.<br><br>Your mission is twofold: Deactivate the central defenses, and extend a lifeline to the survivors. The fate of this forsaken place and its inhabitants hangs in the balance. Will you bring redemption or plunge further into the abyss of its haunting recent past?",
    "about_the_game": "The aftermath of a recently <i>abandoned space station</i>, once poised to propel humanity into a <u>new era</u>, a chilling tale of untapped potential unfurls. Its chambers, hold the enigma of a groundbreaking energy source that was meant to revolutionize our species.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2648550/extras/cce5949cc3a52b665048a5f6447075bf.poster.avif?t=1697741619\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2648550/extras/cce5949cc3a52b665048a5f6447075bf.webm?t=1697741619\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2648550/extras/cce5949cc3a52b665048a5f6447075bf.mp4?t=1697741619\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Chart your <strong>own</strong> course through the abandoned station, navigating your way to its core. Alternatively, venture off the beaten path and uncover the hidden mysteries the station conceals<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2648550/extras/77bc2fa149596791d5504ad40537a257.poster.avif?t=1697741619\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2648550/extras/77bc2fa149596791d5504ad40537a257.webm?t=1697741619\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2648550/extras/77bc2fa149596791d5504ad40537a257.mp4?t=1697741619\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Collect energy chits to <strong>upgrade</strong> your suit and switch on-the-fly to annihilate your enemies<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2648550/extras/0d39aee544b4f3d12120f3bdaef89ce8.poster.avif?t=1697741619\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2648550/extras/0d39aee544b4f3d12120f3bdaef89ce8.webm?t=1697741619\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2648550/extras/0d39aee544b4f3d12120f3bdaef89ce8.mp4?t=1697741619\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Leap, slide, or use your enemies as launchpads to reach new heights \u2013 <strong>fast-paced movement</strong> is your key to survival<br><br>Embark on an urgent mission to uncover the closely guarded secrets that led to its recent catastrophic downfall. Venture deep into the heart of the station, where you'll confront imminent challenges and unveil the hidden truths veiled in darkness.<br><br>Your mission is twofold: Deactivate the central defenses, and extend a lifeline to the survivors. The fate of this forsaken place and its inhabitants hangs in the balance. Will you bring redemption or plunge further into the abyss of its haunting recent past?",
